### Magicbox backend configuration
# Inherits NEO4J_* from the repo-root .env (shared with the LightRAG server).
# Set any of them here to override for this service.

# MAGICBOX_PORT=9622
# MAGICBOX_CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5174

# NEO4J_URI=bolt://localhost:7687
# NEO4J_USERNAME=neo4j
# NEO4J_PASSWORD=password
# NEO4J_DATABASE=neo4j
# NEO4J_WORKSPACE=base
